    <div class="readme-body">

      <div class="rm-sec">
        <h5>What is a model result, and what is an exhibit</h5>
        <p>The <b>door frame</b>, the <b>atlas</b> and the <b>mirrors</b> show measured heights.
        The <b>feature importances</b> and the <b>R²</b> are outputs of the trained XGBoost ensemble.
        Those are the results.</p>
        <p>The <b>Growth Machine</b> is an exhibit, not an instrument. Its lever weights are derived
        from the trained model, but it will accept a country that cannot exist and answer anyway.
        Load a preset to watch it miss a real nation by about 2 cm. Its sanitation, healthcare and
        education indices are normalised 0–100 constructions, labelled <em>index</em> wherever
        they appear, and they are not among the model's 11 features.</p>
