        <p>XGBoost, five-fold bagged disjoint-fold ensemble, trained separately for each sex with
        <b>no sex variable and no country identity in the features</b>. The model never learns which
        country a row belongs to; it has to explain height from childhood conditions alone — that
        exclusion is the whole design, because it forces environment to carry the result.</p>
